of your retail stores

00:28:58.630 --> 00:29:01.460
or in one of your office spaces.

00:29:01.460 --> 00:29:05.630
And just briefly, you
will be-- it's not just

00:29:05.630 --> 00:29:07.562
configuring the app
and pushing the app.

00:29:07.562 --> 00:29:10.020
There are a few things like,
yes, you'll be able to monitor

00:29:10.020 --> 00:29:12.334
