00:29:19.890 --> 00:29:22.420
You can say, hey,
I want my devices

00:29:22.420 --> 00:29:25.330
to connect this network alone.

00:29:25.330 --> 00:29:27.285
And you can even
enforce policies.

00:29:27.285 --> 00:29:29.160
Like if someone is going
to steal the device,

00:29:29.160 --> 00:29:34.440
let's say, you're showing the
device outside your store.

00:29:34.440 --> 00:29:36.230
You can say nobody
will be able to use it.

00:29:36.230 --> 00:29:40.581
You can do a bunch of good
stuff with our Chrome Device

00:29:40.581 --> 00:29:41.080
Management.

00:29:41.080 --> 00:29:43.710
